progress towards your goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock exotic blueprints and gain more reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh and don't forget to just chill and watch how the worm eat all the dirt.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"100 Coins and Counting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2452900/2ddf56255057c2b71f425719b38ff5a9fe34c120.jpg"},{"name":"Piggy Bank Pioneer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2452900/d6b6d584994c1d5b31e7712128c4cac57c78185a.jpg"},{"name":"Cash Stash Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2452900/c1822b26e7d1b7ff1f4501c1369a55b573c09794.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Money","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2452900/7db15814df8dd5c0a7afb7435d44df1f268ae431.jpg"},{"name":"Materialist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2452900/f09bb19be0699bbebfe586be56db2002bb6058a7.jpg"},{"name":"Silverly Sensation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2452900/4f7be2f23d3fc98152084fc88ca410816ab0c87e.jpg"},{"name":"Ready for Gold Rush!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2452900/cca92f8bb660e74b018c29acd273fa1e5e861e98.jpg"},{"name":"Brilliant Findings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2452900/14df19c0bfb3a4e3767ec66dad18e87ffab90509.jpg"},{"name":"Mastery of Craft","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2452900/4f9a5a0e6c92361a5dfe795fa6e45181dd1ca7e6.jpg"},{"name":"Into The Unknown!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2452900/93dfd7ffccd06c18d9183fbca92413975c8dda55.jpg"}],"total":37},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2452900?t=1763823974","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763823974","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/902d9062c7175b14f0f29c7afe0ec5b648fd07df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763823974","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/902d9062c7175b14f0f29c7afe0ec5b648fd07df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763823974","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family,  blacksmiths for generations, harbors an age-old ambition\u2014to forge the ultimate weapon and be the best blacksmith. The key to this legendary creation lies in the Abyss, a fabled realm beneath the earth that holds the rarest mystical materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must manage your mining operation, collect resources, and craft items to sell for profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your mining tools and as you progress towards your goal, you can purchase better mining licences and delve deeper into the earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect mystical ancient relics to gain its power and boost your efficiency. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Purchase mining licences from different areas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy higher tier licences and discover rarer minerals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/extras/73195259fc07099d8cfbc2be18087300.poster.avif?t=1763823974\" width=644 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/extras/73195259fc07099d8cfbc2be18087300.webm?t=1763823974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/extras/73195259fc07099d8cfbc2be18087300.mp4?t=1763823974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use your mining tools and gather raw materials</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the tools and adapt to the circumstances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/extras/53f5f14c4fd994b9c7749f680f8c5b26.poster.avif?t=1763823974\" width=690 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/extras/53f5f14c4fd994b9c7749f680f8c5b26.webm?t=1763823974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/extras/53f5f14c4fd994b9c7749f680f8c5b26.mp4?t=1763823974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run your own shop; sell, haggle and build your fame</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and boost your shop with several furnitures which you can find at mining sites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/extras/1505ff1c381ea54ab553ef83c14ab822.poster.avif?t=1763823974\" width=712 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/extras/1505ff1c381ea54ab553ef83c14ab822.webm?t=1763823974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/extras/1505ff1c381ea54ab553ef83c14ab822.mp4?t=1763823974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Delve depper and deeper and find exotic resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you dig down the rarer minerals you will be able to mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/extras/af88560bca0894a95029a8e58fcc0f32.poster.avif?t=1763823974\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/extras/af88560bca0894a95029a8e58fcc0f32.webm?t=1763823974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/extras/af88560bca0894a95029a8e58fcc0f32.mp4?t=1763823974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock blueprints, craft and sell items for profit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more exotic the item you craft, the more it sells for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/extras/d875f0a5205773364bf0608415ebc706.poster.avif?t=1763823974\" width=628 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/extras/d875f0a5205773364bf0608415ebc706.webm?t=1763823974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/extras/d875f0a5205773364bf0608415ebc706.mp4?t=1763823974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your mining operation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own shop, sell and haggle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your shop's fame and attract more customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Market demand and supply system with dynamic market events. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig out and mine procedural mining sites to gather raw materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find old furnitures and reuse them in your shop to gain boosts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use several different mining tools, each has its own advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools to be more efficient and reach deeper layers to find rarer resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful relics and gain its power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft items to sell for profit and progress towards your goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock exotic blueprints and gain more reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh and don't forget to just chill and watch how the worm eat all the dirt.</p></li></ul>","developers":["OverjoyedGameDevs"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452900/09b8a24a666f05e37cc66a0fd9bad78bd7739cb9/header.jpg?t=1763823974","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 or later / the latest version of SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 670 / Radeon RX 460 or similar<br></li><li><strong>